     {
      "description": "In the Research Article “RAD51 stabilizes neutrophil extracellular traps to compartmentalize inflammation” by L. I. Tsansizi et al. (20 August 2026, 10.1126/science.aed9286), two figure errors were identified. In Fig. 6A, the y axis was incorrectly labeled “Blood Eosinophils,” and fig. S9 and its legend incorrectly referenced “Il6r KOs”; these errors have been corrected to “Lung Eosinophils” and “Il6 KOs,” respectively, and the figures have been replaced. The main text referred to “Lung Eosinophils” and “Il6 KOs” correctly; therefore, neither error affected the data nor its interpretation.",
      "display_url": "scim.ag/47VQWET",
